WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:01.900
One failure.

2
00:00:03.100 --> 00:00:04.100
Then the next.

3
00:00:05.800 --> 00:00:07.200
Cities don't fail one system

4
00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:07.800
at a time.

5
00:00:07.800 --> 00:00:09.500
Power feeds water, water feeds

6
00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:11.000
