24
00:00:40.600 --> 00:00:41.900
Then plan around it.

25
00:00:41.900 --> 00:00:43.200
Let the optimizer pick the

26
00:00:43.200 --> 00:00:44.800
three moves that matter most,

27
00:00:44.800 --> 00:00:46.500
compare plans side by side,

28
00:00:46.500 --> 00:00:47.900
and click any failure to

29
00:00:47.900 --> 00:00:49.500
